### Переменные
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@restaurantId = 1

### ============================================
### РЕСТОРАНЫ
### ============================================

### 1. Получить все рестораны
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants
Accept: application/json

### 2. Получить ресторан по ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Проверить доступность
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/1/availability?date=2025-12-25&time=19:00
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### БРОНИРОВАНИЯ
### ============================================

### 4. Получить все бронирования
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Accept: application/json

### 5. Создать бронирование
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "guestName": "HTTP Test User",
  "guestCount": 4,
  "bookingDate": "2025-12-25",
  "bookingTime": "19:00"
}

### 6. Получить бронирование по ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. Получить бронирования по ресторану
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/restaurant/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. Получить статистику ресторана
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/restaurant/1/stats
Accept: application/json

### 9. Получить бронирования по статусу
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings?status=CONFIRMED
Accept: application/json

### 10. Отменить бронирование
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### ТЕСТОВЫЕ СЦЕНАРИИ
### ============================================

### Сценарий 1: Создать бронирование и проверить статус
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 2,
  "guestName": "Test Scenario 1",
  "guestCount": 2,
  "bookingDate": "2025-12-30",
  "bookingTime": "18:30"
}

> {%
    client.test("Booking created", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 201 || response.status === 200);
        client.assert(response.body.success === true);
        client.global.set("lastBookingId", response.body.data.id);
    });
%}

### Проверить созданное бронирование (через 6 секунд)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{lastBookingId}}
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Booking is confirmed", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.data.status === "CONFIRMED" ||
            response.body.data.status === "CHECKING_AVAILABILITY");
    });
%}

### Сценарий 2: Создать несколько бронирований
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 3,
  "guestName": "Batch Test 1",
  "guestCount": 6,
  "bookingDate": "2025-12-31",
  "bookingTime": "20:00"
}

